// Workspace tying the three modules together for local dev + CI:
//   .                          root module (cmd/scaffold)
//   ./template                 the generic Template (sentinel module path)
//   ./examples/yaml-validator  the worked example
//
// Committed intentionally — CI builds/tests all three. The scaffold copies only
// ./template, so this file never leaks into a generated project.
go 1.25

use (
	.
	./examples/yaml-validator
	./template
)
